{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_82_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_82","textTraditional":"一、十有九年，春，王三月，宋人執滕子嬰齊。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_82_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_82","textTraditional":"二、夏，六月，宋公、曹人、邾人盟於曹南。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_82_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_82","textTraditional":"三、繒子會盟於邾。己酉，邾人執繒子，用之。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_82_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_82","textTraditional":"微國之君，因邾以求與之盟。因己以求與之盟，己迎而執之，惡之，故謹而日之也。用之者，叩其鼻以衈社也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_82_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_82","textTraditional":"四、秋，宋人圍曹。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_82_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_82","textTraditional":"五、衞人伐邢。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_82_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_82","textTraditional":"六、冬，會陳人、蔡人、楚人、鄭人盟於齊。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_82_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_82","textTraditional":"七、梁亡。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_82_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_82","textTraditional":"自亡也。湎於酒，淫於色，心昏耳目塞。上無正長之治，大臣背叛，民為寇盜。梁亡，自亡也。如加力役焉，湎不足道也。梁亡，鄭棄其師。我無加損焉，正名而已矣。梁亡，出惡正也。鄭棄其師，惡其長也。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}